<section class="listener-shell"><div class="listener-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">AI Emotional Listener</span><h1>There is no rush.</h1><p>AI is disclosed here as a listener, reflector and sensor — never as your therapist.</p></div><div class="ai-status"><span class="pulse-dot"></span><%= aiEnabled?'AI provider connected':'Safe local reflection mode' %></div></div>
  <div class="listener-grid"><section class="chat-card card"><div id="chat-stream" class="chat-stream"><div class="system-whisper">Take a breath. This app does not need you to perform.</div><% messages.forEach(m=>{ %><div class="chat-bubble <%= m.sender==='user'?'user-message':'ai-message' %>"><span><%= m.sender==='user'?'You':'Chiedza AI' %></span><p><%= m.content %></p><small><%= new Date(m.createdAt).toLocaleTimeString([], {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}) %></small></div><% }) %></div><div id="crisis-bridge" class="crisis-bridge" hidden></div><form id="ai-form" class="chat-compose"><textarea id="ai-message" maxlength="5000" rows="3" placeholder="Write only what feels possible…" required></textarea><div><span class="hint">AI responses can be wrong. Human care remains authoritative.</span><div class="button-row"><button class="button button-ghost" id="voice-input" type="button" title="Optional voice-to-text input">Voice input</button><button class="button" type="submit">Send gently</button></div></div></form></section>
  <aside class="listener-aside"><div class="card"><span class="eyebrow">What AI can do</span><ul class="clean-list"><li>Listen and reflect</li><li>Notice emotional themes</li><li>Adapt language to capacity</li><li>Route flagged distress to human review</li></ul></div><div class="card safety-card"><span class="eyebrow">What AI cannot do</span><ul class="clean-list"><li>Diagnose you</li><li>Replace a therapist</li><li>Respond to a flagged crisis alone</li><li>Guarantee an interpretation is correct</li></ul></div></aside></div>
</section><script src="/js/ai-chat.js" defer></script>
